    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>For The Hive \u2013 A Brutal, Gory Insect Survival Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For The Hive</strong> is an intense insect survival simulation blending exploration, role-playing, and strategic warfare. Enter a vast, living world where every creature fights to survive\u2014just like you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Brutal, Gory Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about running\u2014it\u2019s about fighting. <strong>Rip enemies apart, decapitate foes, and dismember rivals</strong> in fast-paced, bloody battles. Every encounter is a struggle for dominance, with no mercy for the weak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Beautiful and Immersive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a stunning, ever-changing ecosystem with a full <strong>day-night cycle</strong>. Climb towering trees, scale plants and rocks, or dive into the depths of hidden caves. Every inch of the world is yours to explore\u2014but danger lurks everywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Start as a Tiny Larva \u2013 Grow Into a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin life as a helpless <strong>larva</strong> and fight to survive as you <strong>grow into a mighty queen, a towering beetle, or one of over 20 different species</strong>. Each insect has its own unique abilities, strengths, and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mating &amp; Legacy \u2013 Build Your Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about you\u2014<strong>find a mate, build your colony, and continue your bloodline</strong>. Play as your offspring and shape the future of your species, ensuring your lineage thrives for generations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join a Faction \u2013 Wage War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ally yourself with powerful insect factions and take part in <strong>massive territorial battles</strong>. Whether you conquer, defend, or forge alliances, your choices will shape the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Live the Life of an Insect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for food, gather resources, and stay alive by eating, sleeping, and even <strong>cleaning yourself</strong>. From lone survivalist to colony leader, carve your place in a world where only the fittest thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to rule the wild?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>For The Hive \u2013 A Brutal, Gory Insect Survival Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For The Hive</strong> is an intense insect survival simulation blending exploration, role-playing, and strategic warfare. Enter a vast, living world where every creature fights to survive\u2014just like you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Brutal, Gory Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about running\u2014it\u2019s about fighting. <strong>Rip enemies apart, decapitate foes, and dismember rivals</strong> in fast-paced, bloody battles. Every encounter is a struggle for dominance, with no mercy for the weak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Beautiful and Immersive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a stunning, ever-changing ecosystem with a full <strong>day-night cycle</strong>. Climb towering trees, scale plants and rocks, or dive into the depths of hidden caves. Every inch of the world is yours to explore\u2014but danger lurks everywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Start as a Tiny Larva \u2013 Grow Into a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin life as a helpless <strong>larva</strong> and fight to survive as you <strong>grow into a mighty queen, a towering beetle, or one of over 20 different species</strong>. Each insect has its own unique abilities, strengths, and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mating &amp; Legacy \u2013 Build Your Family</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival isn\u2019t just about you\u2014<strong>find a mate, build your colony, and continue your bloodline</strong>. Play as your offspring and shape the future of your species, ensuring your lineage thrives for generations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join a Faction \u2013 Wage War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ally yourself with powerful insect factions and take part in <strong>massive territorial battles</strong>. Whether you conquer, defend, or forge alliances, your choices will shape the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Live the Life of an Insect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for food, gather resources, and stay alive by eating, sleeping, and even <strong>cleaning yourself</strong>. From lone survivalist to colony leader, carve your place in a world where only the fittest thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to rule the wild?</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive as a tiny insect in a big harsh world. Fight your way to the top of the food chain. Build a strong colony that stands the test of time and become the ruler of the insect world.",
